                                                                                        ['question' => 'Q. Is this like a booze cruise?', 'answer' => '<p>No it’s not a booze cruise! We don’t play games with whipped cream and strawberry jam. No sucking on chocolate bars. No condoms on head. We also sail at Sunset – the booze cruises sail in the daytime when everyone is hungover and it’s far too hot. They are also frequently cancelled due to lack of people and always rammed with lads, which doesn’t make for a great boat party.</p>
